    <MusicURL></MusicURL>
    <comment>Ten-second high-contrast supernatural flicker for the two Despacho RGB DMX fixtures. Full-intensity red with sharp white/orange/violet glitches and real blackout gaps. Fixtures are deliberately offset; the final 300 ms are black.</comment>
